  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Give Directly Support to Refugee Response to New Arrivals in Kiryandongo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deliver large, unconditional cash transfers to refugees who have arrived in Kiryandongo since the latest influx began in December 2023, to empower refugees to establish new businesses, pursue professional      recertification and continue their careers, or seek other livelihood opportunities, fostering economic independence, contributing to the local economy and pursue self-reliance and reduce on the burden on shared resources, translate equate foreign academic documents for refugees and protect gains from previous livelihoods investments.</narrative>
  </description>
